{"id":10016,"name":"basculin-blue-striped","speciesId":550,"dex":550,"form":"other","generation":5,"types":["water"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":92,"defense":65,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":55,"speed":98},"abilities":[{"name":"rock-head","hidden":false},{"name":"adaptability","hidden":false},{"name":"mold-breaker","hidden":true}],"height":10,"weight":180,"baseExp":161,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10016.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10016.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10016.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10016.ogg","genus":"Hostile Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"Red and blue Basculin get along so poorly, they’ll start fighting instantly. These Pokémon are very hostile."},{"version":"white","text":"Red and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the other’s school."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Red- and blue-striped Basculin are very violent and always fighting. They are also remarkably tasty."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Savage, violent Pokémon, red and blue Basculin are always fighting each other over territory."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"When a school of Basculin appears in a lake, everything else disappears, except for Corphish and Crawdaunt. That’s how violent Basculin are."},{"version":"sword","text":"Anglers love the fight this Pokémon puts up on the hook. And there are always more to catch— many people release them into lakes illicitly."},{"version":"shield","text":"In the past, it often appeared on the dinner table. The meat of red-striped Basculin is on the fatty side, and it’s more popular with the youth."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor—this one is gentle—I have categorized it as a regional form given the vast array of shared qualities."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":25,"eggGroups":["water2"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"basculin","speciesId":550,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Acumular dano de recuo"],"species":"basculegion","speciesId":902,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":550,"name":"basculin-red-striped","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/550.png"},{"id":10016,"name":"basculin-blue-striped","form":"other","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10016.png"},{"id":10247,"name":"basculin-white-striped","form":"other","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10247.png"}],"games":[11,14,15,16,17,18,20,25],"moves":[{"id":15,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[11,"lv",7],[14,"lv",7],[15,"lv",7],[16,"lv",7],[17,"lv",5],[18,"lv",5],[20,"lv",24],[25,"lv",24]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",4],[25,"lv",4]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[11,"lv",20],[14,"lv",20],[15,"lv",20],[16,"lv",20],[17,"lv",14],[18,"lv",14],[20,"lv",36],[25,"lv",36],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":37,"learn":[[11,"lv",56],[14,"lv",56],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",56],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",56],[17,"lv",42],[18,"lv",42],[20,"lv",48],[25,"lv",48]]},{"id":38,"learn":[[11,"lv",36],[14,"lv",36],[15,"lv",36],[16,"lv",36],[17,"lv",26],[18,"lv",26],[20,"lv",52],[25,"lv",52],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":39,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":44,"learn":[[11,"lv",10],[14,"lv",10],[15,"lv",10],[16,"lv",10],[17,"lv",7],[18,"lv",7],[20,"lv",16],[25,"lv",16]]},{"id":55,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv